        "surveyID": "110154",
        "narrative": "<p>LAKE TROUT ABUNDANCE WAS LOW, BUT AVERAGE SIZE WAS GOOD.  BOTH LAKE TROUT COLLECTED WERE FROM THE 1982 STOCKING AND HAD EXHIBITED FAST GROWTH BY COOK COUNTY STANDARDS.  THE 1989 STOCKING HAD PROBABLY NOT RECRUITED TO THE SAMPLING GEAR USED IN THE 1990 ASSESSMENT.  THERE WAS NO EVIDENCE OF ANY LAKE TROUT NATURAL REPRODUCTION.</p>",
