        "narrative": "<p>The 1998 lake trout catch was low, although perhaps not unusually low for this lake.  The single fish collected was eight years of age, and may have been an offspring of lake trout stocked in the 1980's.  Lake trout ages are difficult to determine, and this fish may have been mis-aged.  It could have been nine years of age, possibly from the 1989 stocking.No brook trout were collected, despite regular stocking through 1997.  Brook trout survival may have been low due to predation by lake trout, or they may have been concentrated in shallower waters than those sampled in this assessment.</p>",
